[{"answer":"OK, Greg, so I finally managed to read the article you mentioned -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/1.mp3"},{"answer":"the one about the study on gender in physics.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/2.mp3"},{"answer":"About the study of college students done by Akira Miyake and his team?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I was interested that the researchers were actually a mix of psychologists and physicists.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/4.mp3"},{"answer":"That's an unusual combination.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/6.mp3"},{"answer":"I got a little confused at first about which students the study was based on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/7.mp3"},{"answer":"They weren't actually majoring in physics -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/8.mp3"},{"answer":"they were majoring in what's known as the STEM disciplines.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/9.mp3"},{"answer":"That's science, technology, engineering and... and math.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, but they were all doing physics courses as part of their studies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/11.mp3"},{"answer":"That's correct.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/12.mp3"},{"answer":"So as I understood it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Miyake and co started from the fact that women are underrepresented","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/14.mp3"},{"answer":"in introductory physics courses at college,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/15.mp3"},{"answer":"and also that on average,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/16.mp3"},{"answer":"the women who do enrol on these courses perform more poorly than the men.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/17.mp3"},{"answer":"No one really knows why this is the case.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah. But what the researchers wanted to find out","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/19.mp3"},{"answer":"was basically what they could do about the relatively low level of the women's results.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/20.mp3"},{"answer":"But in order to find a solution","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/21.mp3"},{"answer":"they needed to find out more about the nature of the problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Right - now let's see if I can remember...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/23.mp3"},{"answer":"it was that in the physics class,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/24.mp3"},{"answer":"the female students thought the male students all assumed that women weren't any good at physics...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/25.mp3"},{"answer":"was that it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/26-2025-08-26-20-05-15.mp3"},{"answer":"And they thought that the men expected them to get poor results in their tests.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/27.mp3"},{"answer":"That's what the women thought, and that made them nervous, so they did get poor results.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/28.mp3"},{"answer":"But actually they were wrong...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/29.mp3"},{"answer":"No one was making any assumptions about the female students at all.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, what Miyake's team did was quite simple -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/31.mp3"},{"answer":"getting the students to do some writing before they went into the physics class.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/32.mp3"},{"answer":"What did they call it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Values-affirmation -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/34.mp3"},{"answer":"they had to write an essay focusing on things that were significant to them,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/35.mp3"},{"answer":"not particularly to do with the subject they were studying,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/36.mp3"},{"answer":"but more general things like music or people who mattered to them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/38.mp3"},{"answer":"So the idea of doing the writing is that this gets the students thinking in a positive way.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/39.mp3"},{"answer":"And putting these thoughts into words can relax them and help them overcome the psychological factors","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/40.mp3"},{"answer":"that lead to poor performance. Yeah.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/41.mp3"},{"answer":"But what the researchers in the study hadn't expected","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/42.mp3"},{"answer":"was that this one activity raised the women's physics grades from the C to the B range.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/43.mp3"},{"answer":"A huge change.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Pity it wasn't to an A, but still!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/45.mp3"},{"answer":"No, but it does suggest that the women were seriously underperforming beforehand, in comparison with the men.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. Mind you, Miyake's article left out a lot of details.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Like, did the students do the writing just once, or several times?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/48.mp3"},{"answer":"And had they been told why they were doing the writing?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/49.mp3"},{"answer":"That might have affected the results.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/50.mp3"},{"answer":"You mean, if they know the researchers thought it might help them to improve,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/51.mp3"},{"answer":"then they'd just try to fulfill that expectation?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Exactly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/53.mp3"},{"answer":"So anyway, I thought for our project we could do a similar study,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/54.mp3"},{"answer":"but investigate whether it really was the writing activity that had that result.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/55.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/56.mp3"},{"answer":"So we could ask them to do a writing task about something completely different...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/57.mp3"},{"answer":"something more factual?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Like a general knowledge topic.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/60.mp3"},{"answer":"or we could have half the students doing a writing task","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/61.mp3"},{"answer":"and half doing something else, like an oral task.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Or even, half do the same writing task as in the original research","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/63.mp3"},{"answer":"and half do a factual writing task.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Then we'd see if it really is the topic that made the difference, or something else.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/65.mp3"},{"answer":"That's it. Good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/66.mp3"},{"answer":"So at our meeting with the supervisor on Monday","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/67.mp3"},{"answer":"we can tell him we've decided on our project.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/68.mp3"},{"answer":"We should have our aims ready by then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/69.mp3"},{"answer":"I suppose we need to read the original study - the article's just a summary.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/70.mp3"},{"answer":"And there was another article I read, by Smolinsky.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/71.mp3"},{"answer":"It was about her research on how women and men perform in mixed teams in class,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/72.mp3"},{"answer":"compared with single-sex teams and on their own.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Let me guess... the women were better at teamwork.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/74.mp3"},{"answer":"That's what I expected,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/75.mp3"},{"answer":"but actually the men and the women got the same results","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/76.mp3"},{"answer":"whether they were working in teams or on their own.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/77.mp3"},{"answer":"But I guess it's not that relevant to us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/78.mp3"},{"answer":"What worries me anyway is how we're going to get everything done in the time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/79.mp3"},{"answer":"We'll be OK now we know what we're doing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Though I'm not clear how we assess whether the students in our experiment actually make any progress or not...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/81.mp3"},{"answer":"No.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/82.mp3"},{"answer":"We may need some advice on that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/83.mp3"},{"answer":"The main thing's to make sure we have the right size sample,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/84.mp3"},{"answer":"not too big or too small.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/85.mp3"},{"answer":"That shouldn't be difficult.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/86.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, what do we need to do next?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/87.mp3"},{"answer":"We could have a look at the timetable for the science classes...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/88.mp3"},{"answer":"or perhaps we should just make an appointment to see one of the science professors.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/89.mp3"},{"answer":"That'd be better.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/90.mp3"},{"answer":"Great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/91.mp3"},{"answer":"And we could even get to observe one of the classes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/92.mp3"},{"answer":"What for?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/93.mp3"},{"answer":"Well... OK maybe let's just go with your idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/94.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, well...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-3-2023-06-03-12-39-17/95.mp3"}]
